# The Goobi integration runs on a Linux host. Keep its files LF even in a
# Windows checkout, so a copy taken from a Windows machine still runs: a
# CRLF shebang fails as "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter", and a CRLF unit file
# or Goobi config line carries a stray \r into every value.
*.sh text eol=lf
integration/goobi/** text eol=lf
